ind":"announcement","title":"From Next Fest to release 1.0","summary":"Greetings, adventurer!Nicholas here, the dev behind Reveria: Act 1. The time is almost upon us. Reveria: Act 1 releases November 2nd! I've been smoothing out the final rough edges over the past weeks and I'm really happy with the current state of the game. I'd say it's 99.5% of the way toward version 1.0. Super excited to release this into the world soon and see the response!The Next Fest boomA big thanks to everyone who stumbled on the game during Steam Next Fest and decided to wishlist and/or ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T14:10:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042007","verified_at":"2026-10-25T17:14:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5091340-1846651706679533","game_id":"steam-5091340","kind":"announcement","title":"Reveria: Act 1 demo out now!","summary":"Greetings, adventurer!Assemble your party, the time has come. The demo for Reveria: Act 1 is now live! Dive into the wilderness of Reveria's Western District in this free demo that covers the first couple quests and first dungeons of the game. The demo gives access to the Human and Elf races, and to the Paladin, Rogue, Warrior, and Wizard classes. Advance up to level 4 and get a taste of what the adventuring life in Reveria is all about!If you like the demo, a positive review would be incredibly","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T23:11:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679533","verified_at":"2026-10-21T09:43:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5091340-1845383656390924","game_id":"steam-5091340","kind":"announcement","title":"Reveria: Act 1 launches November 2nd!","summary":"Greetings, adventurer!The time has finally come! Prepare for adventure, because Reveria: Act 1 will be released on November 2nd, 2026. You can already try out a demo of the game a week prior during the Steam Next festival. Make sure to wishlist so you get a notification whenever the full game drops!I'm busy applying some final polish to make sure you all have the best possible experience upon launch. Can't wait to see what you all think once you get your hands on the game. Of course, the story l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T10:19:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390924","verified_at":"2026-10-21T09:43:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5091340-1842846814449744","game_id":"steam-5091340","kind":"announcement","title":"What to Expect in Reveria?","summary":"Greetings, adventurer!Nicholas here. With little over a month remaining before the release of Reveria: Act 1's demo during the Steam Next Festival, I thought it'd be nice to shed some light on what you can expect in the game. Remember to Wishlist the game so you get notified whenever it launches!From Humble BeginningsFirst of all, Reveria is inspired by a homebrew D&D campaign I ran for friends a couple of years ago. During our sessions, I gradually created an entire world for my player's charac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T20:01:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814449744","verified_at":"2026-10-21T09:43:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5091340-1841579228666703","game_id":"steam-5091340","kind":"announcement","title":"Reveria: Act 1 is coming soon!","summary":"Greetings, adventurer!It's Nicholas here, the dev behind Reveria: Act 1. I'm so excited that the Steam store page is finally out! It took months of late nights and long weekends sculpting away at this little gem, but (without tooting my own horn too much) I'm really happy with how things are shaping up.Whatever plane of existence it came from, the idea to turn the multi-year homebrew D&D campaign I had ran for friends into a videogame really gripped me. Once the idea sprouted, it quickly turned ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T20:07:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228666703","verified_at":"2026-10-21T09:43:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5091340":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:43Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:43Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5091340":"2026-10-26T08:02:43Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5091340":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:43Z"},"5118860":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:43Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5091340","app_id":5091340,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:29Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"2ea2bbe3ed06a6e4aba94514b814551b64eecf8373602beaa01d439a7a3a3fe2","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Welcome, adventurer! Reveria is a turn-based old school fantasy RPG. Lead a party of up to four aspiring adventurers into the Reverian wilderness. Explore dark dungeons and defeat dangerous foe